# Netlify security headers, applied to every route.
#
# Two directives here are load-bearing for the 3D view, and neither is
# exercised by `npm run dev` (the dev server sends no CSP at all):
#   - connect-src blob:      GLTFLoader unpacks each model's embedded textures
#                            into blob: URLs and reads them back with
#                            ImageBitmapLoader, i.e. fetch() — which connect-src
#                            governs, not img-src. Blocking it rejects the whole
#                            model, not just the texture, so every textured part
#                            silently degrades to a grey box.
#   - script-src 'wasm-unsafe-eval'
#                            motherboard.glb requires EXT_meshopt_compression,
#                            whose decoder compiles WebAssembly. This token
#                            permits WASM only — it does NOT allow JS eval().
#
# There is deliberately no third-party host here other than the Supabase catalog
# API. Fonts used to come from fonts.googleapis.com/fonts.gstatic.com, which sent
# every visitor's IP to Google before they consented to anything; they are now
# self-hosted in public/fonts and declared in src/fonts.css. Re-adding a font CDN
# would reintroduce that transfer.
# Covered by src/tests/cspHeaders.test.js.
/*
  # Netlify already redirects HTTP→HTTPS, but that first plaintext request is
  # still interceptable (SSL stripping). This tells the browser never to try
  # HTTP again for a year. No `preload` token on purpose: preloading is a
  # browser-baked commitment that is slow and awkward to reverse, and it is not
  # needed for the protection above.
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; connect-src 'self' blob: https://igeggndtnmdpauxovnwv.supabase.co; worker-src 'self' blob:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'
